Known existing regression:
- Guest logs contain `FAIL: task 槽位未被实际复用`, the existing Phase 44 task-slot reuse self-test failure already noted in Phase 108. No claim is made that the full guest self-test suite passes.

Scope note:
- Stage-2 passthrough checks existing leaf mappings and rolls back mappings created by the current attempt on conflict. `map_stage2_page()` returns void, so lower-level page-table allocation failure is not observable by this caller.
- No SMMU/IOMMU abstraction was added; Phase 109 scope is PCI BAR transaction safety, per-VM resource query, dynamic requester/ECAM discovery, and precise Stage-2 mapping.
